        },
        "richtext_VrdfJf": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>A few simple clicks connect you to beautiful flowers delivered throughout Redondo Beach. Browse our collection, personalize your selection, and schedule delivery to residences, workplaces, or event venues. Every <a href=\"/collections/bouquet\" title=\"Bouquet\">bouquet</a> reaches its destination fresh, timely, and picture-perfect. Our same-day flower delivery Redondo Beach California service handles urgent occasions with the same care and quality you expect.</p>",
