            "question": "<strong>How do I order from flower shops in Redondo Beach, CA?</strong>",
            "answer": "<p>Place orders online or call directly. Choose your arrangement, add special touches, select delivery timing, and complete payment. We handle everything from design to doorstep.</p>"
